  unitName: Tartarus Demolition Dure
  unitId: 30736
  unitNumber: 1270
  description: When Dure was tasked with intercepting the God Army before it could
    enter the capital, his younger sister supposedly remarked that Dure was a mere
    sacrificial pawn. Despite overwhelming odds, he did not hesitate to engage the
    God Army forces in direct battle. When he spotted a number of powerful disciples
    heading to the East Gate, he passed command to his lieutenant and rushed back
    just in time to save his younger brother. He laughed off an abusive tirade from
    his thankless brother, replying "As commander, I have fulfilled my duty to act
    as a diversion. As a brother, I still have a right to protect my own family."
    History tells that he fought bravely with his younger brother until the fall
    of the empire.
  summonDesc: In the end, I couldn't protect my men, or my younger brother. I had
    hoped they would live to see our father again...
  fusionDesc: Hey now, you think that's enough?<br>You've still got so much more
    power within you! Push your limits!
  evoDesc: The secret to my strength? Accept good and evil alike, without question.
    And live as myself!
  element: 3
  rarity: 6
